[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823042493","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115625#issuecomment-3823042493","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115625","id":3823042493,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j3v-9","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T10:39:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T10:39:24Z","body":"I agree with adding a confirmation popup there, I also misclicked it at least the first time I saw this icon, because I didn't know what it was :sweat_smile: \r\n\r\nOn the flip side, we will 100% get people asking for this confirmation dialog to be removed/possible to disable via an editor settings as they'll want to minimize flow interruptions. I don't think an editor setting would be good there, but maybe we should add a modifier key to skip confirmation (e.g. Ctrl+click). If so the message of the confirmation dialog could also mention that the confirmation can be bypassed with the Ctrl/Cmd modifier.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823042493/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823189895","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115625#issuecomment-3823189895","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115625","id":3823189895,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j4T-H","user":{"login":"HexagonNico","id":51746628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzQ2NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51746628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico","html_url":"https://github.com/HexagonNico","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T11:19:00Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T11:19:00Z","body":"Would a Ctrl+click to bypass the dialog be preferable to a \"[ ] Don't show this again\" checkbox in the dialog? Having to hold down Ctrl could also disrupt the flow.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823189895/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,