om/u/51746628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico","html_url":"https://github.com/HexagonNico","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-31T11:09:49Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T11:09:49Z","body":"Added the ability to skip the dialog by holding Shift.\r\n\r\nI kept the checkbox instead of reversing the behavior when the editor setting is set to false like it works for the animation track creation because the dialog for creating animation tracks is also used to create the reset track, while the \"Make unique\" dialog doesn't have any other option, so it wouldn't make much sense to hold shift to show the dialog when the setting is set to false.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3828164039/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]